# ── .sync-filter ──────────────────────────────────────
# Lines = patterns to REMOVE before syncing to public repo.
# !pattern = negate (keep even if a broader pattern matched).
# Blank lines and #comments are ignored.

# ── Secrets & env ─────────────────────────────────────
.env
.env.*
!.env.example

# ── Sync infrastructure (public repo doesn't need these) ──
.github/workflows/sync-public.yml
.github/workflows/sync-to-public.yml
.sync-filter

# ── Dev artifacts & debug logs ────────────────────────
.playwright-mcp/
playwright-report/
test-results/
blob-report/
*.bak
*.log
coverage-report.txt

# ── Design prototype (not part of the running app) ────
v0-reference/

# ── Backend dev-only scripts ──────────────────────────
sigma-backend/scripts/test_report_pipeline.py
sigma-backend/scripts/seed_e2e_data.py
sigma-backend/scripts/clean_database.py

# ── Codex task prompts (one-time refactoring prompts) ─
CODEX-*.md

# ══════════════════════════════════════════════════════
# INTENTIONALLY PUBLIC — harness engineering artifacts
# ══════════════════════════════════════════════════════
# The following files are normally classified as PRIVATE
# per the sync-filter skill's decision tree. They are
# kept PUBLIC here to enable full workflow review and
# cross-session discussion with Claude.
#
# Files kept public:
#   AGENTS.md          — cross-tool agent rules
#   CLAUDE.md          — Claude Code specific config
#   CHANGELOG.md       — keep-a-changelog history
#   .harness/          — progress tracker, planning
#   .cursor/           — Cursor rules (if present)
#   .github/workflows/ — CI quality gates (except sync)
#   hooks/             — deterministic quality hooks
#   skills/            — project-specific domain skills
#
# To re-privatize after the review, uncomment this block:
# AGENTS.md
# CLAUDE.md
# CHANGELOG.md
# .harness/
# .cursor/
# hooks/
# skills/
